  "bodyHash": "56e6799d22f05d58",
  "content": "你好世界<p><strong>此模组需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hammer-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;HammerLib</a>。</strong></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vC8fGUv.png\" width=\"676\" height=\"221\" /></p>\n<p>这是一个完全重写旧版 PlayerStats 和 PlayerStats 2 的作品，作者是 <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Zeitheron</span>&nbsp;和 xMrVizzy，但使用了全新的 HammerLib。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组允许玩家通过经验值和<img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/improvableskills/skills_book.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;技能书来强化自身能力。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>技能表：</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/accelerated_furnace_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;加速熔炉：</strong>此技能可提升熔炼速度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/alchemist_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;炼金术士</strong>: 此技能&nbsp;可提升酿造台速度。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/alchemist.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/attack_speed_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;攻击速度</strong>: 此技能可提升任何工具/武器的打击速度。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/cutting_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>切割:</strong> 此技能可提升切割斧的速度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/generic_protection_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>坚韧皮肤</strong>: 此技能使你的皮肤对敌人更具抵抗力（增加额外护甲点）。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/generic_protection.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/dexterous_arms_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>灵巧手臂</strong>: 此技能可使你的工具和装备更持久。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/dexterous_arms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/digging_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>挖掘:</strong> 此技能可提升挖掘铲的速度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/enchanter_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>附魔师</strong>: 此技能可降低物品附魔所需的最小等级。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/enchanter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/ender_manipulator_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>末影操控者</strong>: 此技能可减少使用末影珍珠时受到的伤害。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/ender_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/xp_plus_hovered.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>经验收割</strong>: 此技能可增加从采矿、驯养动物、钓鱼及击杀怪物中获得的经验值。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/xp_plus.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/health_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>额外生命值</strong>: 此技能可提升你的最大生命值至 +20 HP（10颗心）。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/health.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/growth_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>快速生长</strong>: 此技能会随机向周围植物施加骨粉。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/growth.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/fast_swimmer_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>敏捷游泳:</strong> 此技能可提升水中的移动速度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/huckster_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>商贾:</strong> 此技能可降低村民交易价格。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/huckster.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/ladder_king_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>攀爬王者:</strong> 此技能可提升在梯子上的攀爬速度。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/leaper_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>跳跃大师:</strong> 此技能可提升玩家跳跃高度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/luck_of_the_sea_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>海洋恩赐</strong>: 此技能可吸引鱼咬你的鱼钩。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/luck_of_the_sea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/mining_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>采矿:</strong> 此技能可提升矿镐的开采速度。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/obsidian_skin_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>黑曜石皮肤:</strong> 此技能可减少火焰/岩浆造成的伤害。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/obsidian_skin.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/pvp_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>PvP 保护</strong>: 此技能可减少 PvP 类型伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/atkdmg_ranged_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>精准箭矢</strong>: 此技能可提升对所有目标造成的远程伤害。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/atkdmg_ranged.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/silent_foot_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>静音脚步</strong>: 此技能可减少你移动时产生的震动范围。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/silent_foot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/soft_landing_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>软着陆:</strong> 此技能可减少玩家坠落造成的伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/soul_speed_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>灵魂速度</strong>: 此技能可在灵魂沙上提升移动速度，但同时会像被附魔一样损坏你的靴子。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/soul_speed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/atkdmg_melee_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp></strong><strong>重拳出击:</strong> 此技能可对任何目标造成更高的近战伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/treasure_sands_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>沙滩宝藏:</strong> 此技能允许你在沙子中寻找宝物。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/renders/skill_scrolls/treasure_sands.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></li>\n<li><del><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/skills/ore_finder_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #800000;\">宝藏</span>搜寻者:</strong>&nbsp;此技能允许玩家在采矿时发现稀有资源。</span></del></li>\n<li><del><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>物品修复器:</strong> 此技能会缓慢修复双手持有的物品和穿戴的护甲。</span></del></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>能力表：</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/abilities/auto_xp_bank_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>自动 XP 银行:</strong> 此能力允许你随身携带精确数量的经验值，多余的经验将存入 XP 银行。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/abilities/anvil_normal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>铁匠:</strong> 此能力打开一个修理菜单，其功能与普通铁砧完全一致。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/abilities/crafter_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>工匠:</strong> 此能力打开一个 3x3 的合成菜单，其功能与普通工作台完全一致。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/abilities/enchanting_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>附魔师:</strong> 此能力打开附魔菜单。你可以点击“附魔力”标签来提高你的便携式附魔台的等级。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/abilities/magnetism_hovered.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>磁力:</strong> 此能力允许你启用一个磁铁，将 configurable 范围内的所有物品吸向你。</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>其他小功能：</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dragon-forge/ImprovableSkills/master/src/main/resources/assets/improvableskills/textures/item/parchment_fragment.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp>羊皮纸碎片:</strong> 此物品可用于创建上述的能力卷轴。请查看游戏内关于能力卷轴的提示，或在 JEI 中查看物品用法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>感谢以下人士：</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/Shalazhar_13\">Shalazhar_13 (Khaoss)</a> - 西班牙语翻译</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a title=\"Linkout to GitHub\" href=\"https://github.com/ACGaming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ACGaming</a> - 德语翻译</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/Yukensha\">Yukensha</a> - 精灵图</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>权限：</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>你可以将此模组用于你的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>未经 Modrinth/CurseForge 下载链接授权及我的许可（PM 给 <a href=\"https://me.zeith.gay/\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron</a>或通过 Discord），禁止将此模组重新发布到其他网站。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>禁止将此模组（或 DragonForge 团队的其他任何模组）整合进你自己的模组中。但允许构建插件，不过最好先友善地 PM 一下。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本模组仅支持最新版 Minecraft，请勿要求降级！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://ds.zeith.org/dev\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>有任何问题需要讨论？需要帮助使用 API？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>加入 Discord 服务器，并在 <a href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />Twitter</a> 上关注 Zeitheron！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>如果你希望支持我的工作，可以通过 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Patreon</a> 成为赞助人。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\" /></strong></p>",
